00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:23.180
Yeah.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:31.070
<i>Oh, come on. If you look that relieved, 
I can't possibly take it back.</i>

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:35.230
<i>I-It's fine. I just have to 
not fall in love with Kou.</i>

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:39.440
