Trying to seem like she
 doesn't care about Kou.

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:49.200
Trying to seem like she
 doesn't care about Kou.

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:53.700
Trying to seem like she
 doesn't care about Kou.

