What's wrong? Not feeling well?

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:29.350
<i>Then, when it came to it...</i>

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.660
<i>I wanted Kou to get off the train.</i>

00:21:34.690 --> 00:21:37.280
<i>Yuuri... I'm sorry.</i>

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:46.280
<i>I also... I also...</i>

00:21:48.060 --> 00:21:49.370
<i>...love Kou.</i>

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:40.980
Next Episode . . .

00:23:28.390 --> 00:23:32.050
I feel like God is testing me, somehow.

00:23:33.620 --> 00:23:39.390
But I can't hide my love for Kou anymore.
